LOCATION:Herold Mahoney Library Gallery - Petaluma Campus
SUMMARY:Beautiful TRASH Exhibit - Opening Reception
DESCRIPTION:The Beautiful TRASH exhibit features artworks from six studen
 ts who participated in a seven-week art residency program. TRASH (The Rec
 ology Artstart Student Hub) is a collaboration between Recology Sonoma Ma
 rin and Artstart. The students selected trash from Recology's Materials R
 ecovery Facility and created art that inspires reflection on our habits w
 ith waste.  An SRJC Libraries collaboration with Recology Sonoma Marin an
 d Artstart.  Opening reception for the Beautiful TRASH exhibit: 4:30-6:30
 pm.  Ongoing exhibit: August 24 to December 11\, 2026.  SRJC Petaluma: 68
 0 Sonoma Mtn. Parkway\, Petaluma\, CA 94954-2522For more information abou
 t the Herold Mahoney Library Gallery\, visit their website here. (https:/
 /libraries.santarosa.edu/mahoney_gallery)  &#160\;Art exhibits are funded
  by the Art in the SRJC Libraries Endowment (https://give.santarosa.edu/g
 ive/634815#!/donation/checkout) / SRJC Foundation.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Beautiful TRASH exhibit features ar
 tworks from six students who participated in a seven-week art residency p
 rogram. TRASH (The Recology Artstart Student Hub) is a collaboration betw
 een Recology Sonoma Marin and Artstart. The students selected trash from 
 Recology's Materials Recovery Facility and created art that inspires refl
 ection on our habits with waste.</p><p>  An SRJC Libraries collaboration 
 with Recology Sonoma Marin and Artstart.</p><p>  Opening reception for th
 e Beautiful TRASH exhibit: 4:30-6:30pm.<br />  Ongoing exhibit: August 24
  to December 11\, 2026.<br />  SRJC Petaluma: 680 Sonoma Mtn. Parkway\, P
 etaluma\, CA 94954-2522</p><p><a href="https://libraries.santarosa.edu/ma
 honey_gallery" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information about 
 the Herold Mahoney Library Gallery\, visit their website here.</a></p><p>
   &#160\;</p><p><em>Art exhibits are funded by the <a href="https://give.
 santarosa.edu/give/634815#!/donation/checkout" target="_blank" rel="noope
 ner">Art in the SRJC Libraries Endowment</a> / <strong>SRJC Foundation</s
 trong>.</em></p>
