 n of Solito: A memoir by Javier Zamora.</p><p>  This event will be in Eng
 lish.</p><p><a href="https://intercultural.santarosa.edu/herencia" target
 ="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information\, visit SRJC's Intercultura
