BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T143000
LOCATION:Mike Smith Hall\, PC 500 - SRJC Petaluma
SUMMARY:Identity and Leadership Summit
DESCRIPTION:The Identity and Leadership Summit is an event where students
  are able to learn about how to be leaders and social justice advocates. 
  The goal is that it prepares students to understand who they are\, build
  right relationships\, examine power\, and take meaningful action with th
 e campus and South County community. Grounded in SRJC Petaluma's small-ca
 mpus experience and commitment to connection\, the framework recognizes t
 hat leadership develops through identity\, place\, reflection\, relations
 hip\, and shared responsibility.  Keynote: Dr. Bryon ReavesFor more infor
 mation\, visit the Identity and Leadership Summit website here.  &#160\; 
  SRJC Petaluma - 680 Sonoma Mountain Pkwy\, Petaluma\, CA 94954
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The <em>Identity and Leadership Summit<
 /em> is an event where students are able to learn about how to be leaders
  and social justice advocates.</p><p>  The goal is that it prepares stude
 nts to understand who they are\, build right relationships\, examine powe
 r\, and take meaningful action with the campus and South County community
 . Grounded in SRJC Petaluma's small-campus experience and commitment to c
 onnection\, the framework recognizes that leadership develops through ide
 ntity\, place\, reflection\, relationship\, and shared responsibility.</p
 ><p>  Keynote: Dr. Bryon Reaves</p><p><a href="https://petaluma.santarosa
 .edu/identity-and-leadership-summit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For m
 ore information\, visit the <em>Identity and Leadership Summit</em> websi
 te here.</a></p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  SRJC Petaluma - 680 Sonoma Mountain 
 Pkwy\, Petaluma\, CA 94954</p>
