DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T150000
LOCATION:Burbank Auditorium Studio Theatre - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Emilia - SRJC Theatre Arts
DESCRIPTION:Emilia by Morgan Lloyd Malcolm is a passionate\, feminist rei
 magining of the life of 17th-century poet and musician Emilia Bassano. Th
 e play\, performed by an all-female cast\, delves into her journey from a
  privileged childhood\, to becoming a trailblazing poet\, and a woman fig
 hting for her say in a male-dominated world.  &#160\;Ticketing:Visit SRJC
 's Theatre Arts tickets page for details and tickets. (https://srjc.unive
 rsitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=34)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><em>Emilia</em> by Morgan Lloyd Malcolm i
 s a passionate\, feminist reimagining of the life of 17th-century poet an
 d musician Emilia Bassano. The play\, performed by an all-female cast\, d
 elves into her journey from a privileged childhood\, to becoming a trailb
 lazing poet\, and a woman fighting for her say in a male-dominated world.
 </p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><strong>Ticketing:</strong><a href="https://srjc.u
 niversitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=34" target="_blank" rel="noope
 ner">Visit SRJC's Theatre Arts tickets page for details and tickets.</a><
 /p>
