BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261006T140000
LOCATION:Petaluma Campus
SUMMARY:Free Farmer's Market - SRJC Petaluma
DESCRIPTION:The Free Farmer's Market is located under the outdoor canopy\
 , between buildings 400 &amp\; 500.  For faster check-in\, download the "
 MySRJC App" and register with Redwood Empire Food Bank prior to the event
 .  Don't forget to bring your own grocery bags\, some bags will be provid
 ed on a first come first serve basis.  Can't make it? Leftover produce an
 d other items are moved to the Welcome &amp\; Connect Center Food Pantry 
 after each event and will stay there through the end of the week.  Contac
 t information:Petaluma Welcome &amp\; Connect Center (https://petaluma.sa
 ntarosa.edu/welcome)  (petalumawelcome@santarosa.edu)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Free Farmer's Market is located und
 er the outdoor canopy\, between buildings 400 &amp\; 500.</p><p>  For fas
 ter check-in\, download the "MySRJC App" and register with Redwood Empire
  Food Bank prior to the event.</p><p>  Don't forget to bring your own gro
 cery bags\, some bags will be provided on a first come first serve basis.
 </p><p>  Can't make it? Leftover produce and other items are moved to the
  Welcome &amp\; Connect Center Food Pantry after each event and will stay
  there through the end of the week.</p><p>  Contact information:</p><p><a
  href="https://petaluma.santarosa.edu/welcome" target="_blank" rel="noope
 ner">Petaluma Welcome &amp\; Connect Center</a></p><p>  (petalumawelcome@
 santarosa.edu)</p>
