 d musician Emilia Bassano. The play\, performed by an all-female cast\, d
 elves into her journey from a privileged childhood\, to becoming a trailb
 lazing poet\, and a woman fighting for her say in a male-dominated world.
 </p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><strong>Ticketing:</strong><a href="https://srjc.u
 niversitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?id=1797" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
