X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T150000
LOCATION:SRJC Petaluma
SUMMARY:LumaFest 2026
DESCRIPTION:Each year\, LumaFest brings community members together for ou
 r educational open house and Día de los Muertos celebration\, giving gue
 sts an opportunity to experience the energy and diversity of our communit
 y\, explore college and career pathways\, and to connect with SRJC progra
 ms and local community organizations. From colorful performances and hand
 s- on art activities to live music\, and local food favorites\, there's s
 omething for everyone at SRJC Petaluma's biggest event of the year.  Whet
 her you're visiting with family\, friends\, or flying solo\, you'll find 
 inspiration around every corner.For more information\, visit the LumaFest
  website here. (https://lumafest.santarosa.edu/)  &#160\;SRJC Petaluma - 
 680 Sonoma Mountain Pkwy\, Petaluma\, CA 94954
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Each year\, <strong>LumaFest brings com
 munity members together for our educational open house and Día de los Mu
 ertos celebration</strong>\, giving guests an opportunity to experience t
 he energy and diversity of our community\, explore college and career pat
 hways\, and to connect with SRJC programs and local community organizatio
 ns. From colorful performances and hands- on art activities to live music
 \, and local food favorites\, there's something for everyone at SRJC Peta
 luma's biggest event of the year.</p><p>  Whether you're visiting with fa
 mily\, friends\, or flying solo\, you'll find inspiration around every co
 rner.</p><p><a href="https://lumafest.santarosa.edu/" target="_blank" rel
 ="noopener">For more information\, visit the LumaFest website here.</a></
 p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><strong>SRJC Petaluma - 680 Sonoma Mountain Pkwy\, P
 etaluma\, CA 94954</strong></p>
