 tunities to work within your area of study\, and find out about steps you
  can take now to start building your experience in your field of study.Fo
 r more information\, visit our PetalumaStudent Success Events &amp\; Work
 shops website here.  &#160\;  Career &amp\; Academic Pathway Career Night
  - Tools &amp\; Trades  From 6 to 8pm at SRJC Petaluma Student Engagement
  &amp\; Success Center: Mike Smith Hall\, Building 500\, Room 114  SRJC P
 etaluma - 680 Sonoma Mountain Pkwy\, Petaluma\, CA 94954
