 amp\; Trades Career and Academic Pathway\, connect and hear from professi
 onals who work in the areas of study within the Tools &amp\; Trades pathw
 ay\, learn about opportunities to work within your area of study\, and fi
 nd out about steps you can take now to start building your experience in 
 your field of study.</p><p><a href="https://petaluma.santarosa.edu/worksh
 op-schedule" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information\, visit 
 our <em>Petaluma</em><em>Student Success Events &amp\; Workshops</em> web
 site here.</a></p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  Career &amp\; Academic Pathway Car
 eer Night - Tools &amp\; Trades</p><p>  From 6 to 8pm at SRJC Petaluma St
 udent Engagement &amp\; Success Center: Mike Smith Hall\, Building 500\, 
 Room 114<br />  SRJC Petaluma - 680 Sonoma Mountain Pkwy\, Petaluma\, CA 
 94954</p>
