BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T160000
LOCATION:Burbank Auditorium\, Main Stage Theatre - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Disney's Frozen - SRJC Theatre Arts
DESCRIPTION:Frozen the musical is based on the 2013 Disney animated film\
 , focusing on the\, estranged relationship between royal sisters Elsa and
  Anna. When Elsa loses control of her ice powers the kingdom is plunged i
 nto eternal winter\, Elsa flees\, and Anna embarks on a journey with Kris
 toff\, Sven\, and Olaf to find her sister and heal the kingdom.Ticketing:
 Visit SRJC's Theatre Arts tickets page for details and tickets. (https://
 srjc.universitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=37)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><em>Frozen</em> the musical is based on t
 he 2013 Disney animated film\, focusing on the\, estranged relationship b
 etween royal sisters Elsa and Anna. When Elsa loses control of her ice po
 wers the kingdom is plunged into eternal winter\, Elsa flees\, and Anna e
 mbarks on a journey with Kristoff\, Sven\, and Olaf to find her sister an
 d heal the kingdom.</p><p><strong>Ticketing:</strong><a href="https://srj
 c.universitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=37" target="_blank" rel="no
 opener">Visit SRJC's Theatre Arts tickets page for details and tickets.</
 a></p>
