X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261130
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
LOCATION:Herold Mahoney Library Gallery - Petaluma Campus
SUMMARY:Beautiful TRASH Exhibit
DESCRIPTION:The Beautiful TRASH exhibit features artworks from six studen
 ts who participated in a seven-week art residency program.  The students 
 selected trash from Recology's Materials Recovery Facility and created ar
 t that inspires reflection on our habits with waste.  TRASH (The Recology
  Artstart Student Hub) is a collaboration between Recology Sonoma Marin a
 nd Artstart.  This event is an SRJC Libraries collaboration with Recology
  Sonoma Marin and Artstart.  &#160\;For more information about the Herold
  Mahoney Library Gallery\, visit their website here. (https://libraries.s
 antarosa.edu/mahoney_gallery)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Beautiful TRASH exhibit features ar
 tworks from six students who participated in a seven-week art residency p
 rogram.</p><p>  The students selected trash from Recology's Materials Rec
 overy Facility and created art that inspires reflection on our habits wit
 h waste.</p><p>  TRASH (The Recology Artstart Student Hub) is a collabora
 tion between Recology Sonoma Marin and Artstart.</p><p>  This event is an
  SRJC Libraries collaboration with Recology Sonoma Marin and Artstart.</p
 ><p>  &#160\;</p><p><a href="https://libraries.santarosa.edu/mahoney_gall
 ery" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information about the Herold
  Mahoney Library Gallery\, visit their website here.</a></p>
